                reserved: true,
                functions: [],
                note: "Held high only by the RP2350\'s on-chip pull-up (about 50k to 3.3 V); the board adds nothing on this line. Holding RUN low is no power-off: the board still draws a typical 388 uA from VBUS, more than in the P1.7 low-power state (148 uA). To de-power the RP2350, pull 3V3_EN low instead.",
            ),
